3. AirPlay 2 receiver, pairing and streaming layers
   Files:
     backend/app/engine/airplay/server.py
     backend/app/engine/airplay/bitflags.py
     backend/app/engine/airplay/pairing/hap.py
     backend/app/engine/airplay/pairing/srp.py
     backend/app/engine/airplay/connections/*.py
   Provenance:
     Derived from openairplay "airplay2-receiver" (https://github.com/openairplay
