4. DLNA / Xiaomi-cloud control engine
   Files:
     backend/app/engine/dlna/*.py
     backend/app/engine/mi_account.py
     backend/app/engine/mina_auth.py
     backend/app/engine/conversation.py
     backend/app/engine/speaker.py
   Provenance:
     Ported from MiAir (https://github.com/KiriChen-Wind/MiAir).
     QR-code login flow references xiaomusic (https://github.com/hanxi/xiaomusic);
