   License: MIT (MiAir).

5. AirPlay 2 bundled binaries
   The standard container image bundles prebuilt Shairport Sync 5.5.2
   (https://github.com/mikebrady/shairport-sync) and NQPTP 1.2.8
   (https://github.com/openairplay/nqptp), which handle AirPlay 2 pairing,
   buffered audio and PTP timing.
   License: GNU General Public License, version 2.0-or-later (Shairport Sync);
   NQPTP is a GPLv2 PTP daemon.

6. AirPlay metadata reference
   Files:
     backend/app/engine/airplay/shairport_metadata.py
   Provenance:
   Reference implementation based on shairport-sync-metadata-reader
   (https://github.com/mikebrady/shairport-sync-metadata-reader).

